    "mapObject.land-of-light.land-of-light-objects.creatureBank.lolstatue.name": "超古代战士雕像",
    "mapObject.land-of-light.land-of-light-objects.creatureBank.lolstatue.onGuarded": "你发现了超古代战士的雕像，你好奇心驱使你上前打量了起来。当你触摸雕像的时候，它突然活了过来！",
